BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:akl-meal-2026-10-09-1730@joshuamorley.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261010T093353Z
DTSTART:20261009T043000Z
DTEND:20261009T051500Z
SUMMARY:🍽 Carb-heavy dinner before the 33 km
DESCRIPTION:Chicken and tomato pasta · about 150 g of carbs · 25 min\n\n
 • 150 g dry spaghetti or penne (about 110 g carbs)\n• 150 g skinless c
 hicken breast\, sliced thin\n• ½ jar (about 250 g) plain tomato pasta s
 auce\n• 1 garlic clove\, a pinch of salt\, a little olive oil\n• 2 sli
 ces white bread or a small white roll on the side (about 30 g carbs)\n\n1.
  Boil the pasta in well-salted water.\n2. Brown the chicken in a little oi
 l\, add the garlic\, then the sauce. Simmer 5 min.\n3. Toss through the dr
 ained pasta. Skip the cheese and keep the veg light tonight.\n\nhttps://jo
 shuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#fuel
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#fuel
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
