BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:akl-meal-2026-10-17-1730@joshuamorley.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261010T093353Z
DTSTART:20261017T043000Z
DTEND:20261017T051500Z
SUMMARY:🍽 Carb-heavy dinner before the half
DESCRIPTION:Teriyaki chicken rice bowl · about 150 g of carbs · 25 min\n\
 n• 1 cup (about 185 g) dry white rice\, about 2.5 cups cooked (about 110
  g carbs)\n• 150 g skinless chicken breast or thigh\, diced\n• 3 tbsp 
 teriyaki sauce (about 15 g carbs)\n• 1 small carrot\, grated\n• 250 ml
  apple or orange juice with it (about 25 g carbs)\n\n1. Cook the rice.\n2.
  Brown the chicken\, add the teriyaki and a splash of water\, and cook unt
 il sticky.\n3. Pile on the rice with the carrot. White rice\, not brown\, 
 the night before a big run.\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan
 /#fuel
