DTEND:20261024T051500Z
SUMMARY:🍽 Race-eve dinner rehearsal
DESCRIPTION:Eat exactly what you plan to have on Sat 31 Oct\, at the same t
 ime.\n\nTeriyaki chicken rice bowl · about 150 g of carbs · 25 min\n\n
 • 1 cup (about 185 g) dry white rice\, about 2.5 cups cooked (about 110 
 g carbs)\n• 150 g skinless chicken breast or thigh\, diced\n• 3 tbsp t
 eriyaki sauce (about 15 g carbs)\n• 1 small carrot\, grated\n• 250 ml 
 apple or orange juice with it (about 25 g carbs)\n\n1. Cook the rice.\n2. 
 Brown the chicken\, add the teriyaki and a splash of water\, and cook unti
 l sticky.\n3. Pile on the rice with the carrot. White rice\, not brown\, t
 he night before a big run.\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/
 #fuel
