UID:akl-meal-2026-10-30-0700@joshuamorley.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261010T093353Z
DTSTART:20261029T180000Z
DTEND:20261029T184500Z
SUMMARY:🍽 Carb load day 1
DESCRIPTION:Carb-load day menu · about 700 g of carbs\n\n• Breakfast: 2 
 bagels with jam and 500 ml juice (about 170 g)\n• Morning: a banana and 
 2 rice cakes with honey (about 55 g)\n• Lunch: white-bread ham sandwich 
 (4 slices)\, 50 g pretzels\, 500 ml sports drink (about 130 g)\n• Aftern
 oon: 3 crumpets with golden syrup and a glass of juice (about 100 g)\n• 
 Dinner: the chicken and tomato pasta or the rice bowl (about 150 g)\n• E
 vening: a pot of rice pudding and a handful of lollies (about 90 g)\n\n1. 
 Spread it across the day. Graze\, don't stuff.\n2. Swap in anything from t
 he carbs table on the Fuel tab\, keeping fibre and fat low.\n3. Sip water 
 or electrolyte drink all day. Pale yellow urine is the goal.\n\nhttps://jo
 shuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#fuel
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#fuel
